## Stage A — Implement CI4 Command + Service

### A1) New command
Create:
- app/Commands/ChatGPTExport.php

Command name:
- ops:chatgpt-export

Usage:
- php spark ops:chatgpt-export
Options:
- --input=docs/chatgpt/raw/conversations.json
- --outdir=docs/chatgpt/derived
- --state=docs/chatgpt/state/chatgpt_export_state.json
- --mode=full|quick (quick skips tag scan + heavy checks)

Exit codes:
- 0 success
- 2 missing input file
- 3 invalid JSON
- 4 write error

### A2) New service
Create:
- app/Libraries/Ops/ChatGPTExportService.php

Responsibilities:
- read json file
- parse multiple export variants:
  - array root
  - { conversations: [] }
  - mapping object keyed by message id
- normalize message text:
  - content.parts array
  - content.text
  - string content
- output CSV safely:
  - proper CSV escaping for quotes/newlines/commas
- compute hash per row:
  - sha256(conversation_id|message_id|role|message_text)

Output schema MUST match docs/chatgpt/workflows/export_to_csv.md

